sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GamesController
    participant GameProxyService
    participant ApiGamesController
    participant GameService
    participant GameRepository
    participant Database

    User->>GamesController: GET /Games/Create
    GamesController-->>User: Display Create Form
    
    User->>GamesController: Submit Form (POST)
    Note right of GamesController: Attach Owner ID and Process Image
    
    GamesController->>GameProxyService: CreateGameAsync(game)
    GameProxyService->>ApiGamesController: POST /api/games
    
    ApiGamesController->>GameService: AddGame(game)
    GameService->>GameRepository: Add(entity)
    GameRepository->>Database: SaveChanges
    
    Database-->>GameRepository: Success
    GameRepository-->>GameService: Success
    GameService-->>ApiGamesController: Created
    ApiGamesController-->>GameProxyService: 201 Created
    GameProxyService-->>GamesController: Success
    
    GamesController-->>User: Redirect to Index
